CO 2018 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2018-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Mapes","x":"The team is successfully managing inflationary headwinds, which have been compounded by trade tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2018-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vince Petrella","x":"The higher LIFO charge reflects higher raw material inflation in the quarter and the estimated impact of U.S. trade tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2018-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Mapes","x":"I made the comment -- look, we -- traditionally, when we have provided price increases out in the marketplace, there's always some of your channel partners or individuals that might be pulling some of that forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2018-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vince Petrella","x":"We've largely passed through on a dollar basis the inflationary increases across our manufacturing businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2018-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Mapes","x":"We've also made strong progress streamlining commercial and back office functions and are benefiting from procurement synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2018-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vince Petrella","x":"…with the progression of the business and our price cost management, the drive to improve our productivity and improve our operational performance and excellence through our business in this type of volume environment, while still integrating and restructuring our combined European businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2018-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vincent Petrella","x":"We incurred a $3.5 million LIFO charge reflecting raw material inflation and the estimated impact of US trade tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2018-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vincent Petrella","x":"Pricing performance reflected the benefits of prior pricing actions and the surcharge applied to recover tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2018-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vincent Petrella","x":"There will be spot cases here and there of having to take some pricing actions, but the broad price increases that we've seen this year, I think, will moderate into the fourth quarter from what we see on input costs so far in this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2018-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Joseph O'Dea","x":"And how do you think that sets up for next year just given what you've had to do so far, the ability to continue taking price up as we move into next year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2018-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Walter Liptak","x":"But, after this restructuring is done, the integration is done, what would be a normal run rate for you?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2019-02-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We did this while successfully navigating inflationary pressures and dynamic trading tariff uncertainties to deliver value for all of our stakeholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2019-02-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We generated 5.6% of prized offset broad inflationary pressures and recover U.S. tariffs to surcharges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2019-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"Right now the guidance that have provided in terms of pricing as it unfolds during the course of the year assumes that we do not put additional price increases into the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2019-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mircea Dobre","x":"Or is the color that you provided in terms of how pricing is progressing simply a factor of price increases that we have already sort of put through in 2018 hearing over into 2019?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"…that we brought into the portfolio we knew that there will be challenges associated with us addressing that particular restructuring as we stated we believe strongly that we'll begin to turn that in the back half of 2019 and begin to have that into a structure we begin we can grow from that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2018 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We certainly have had product areas that we have been able to grow from that portfolio but we've not able to see that as we've been doing the broader restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2019-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"The segments 6.3% higher price reflects prior pricing actions and a reduction in tariff surcharges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2019-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"We expect Americas Welding segments price to narrow further in the second quarter as we recognized less contribution from tariff surcharges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2019-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"I think part of that was, to your question on pricing dynamics, if there was an impact on order patterns and sales in any particular period, it would have been in the prior year, because the prior year had price increases coming out in April.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2019-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"We raised prices in February in '18 as well as in April and they were escalating raw material prices and tariff discussions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2019-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"As the restructuring and integration process has unfolded, Walt, what's happened is that the sales declines are leading the cost decline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2019-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"So we are continuing to spend on integration activities and new systems implementations and restructuring the manufacturing and SG&A footprint and activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2019-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Farley","x":"And then given that this would pass straight through to the customer, will the removal of tariffs actually be accretive to margins?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2019-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"Obviously, there are some other dynamics in that marketplace relative to some of our products that are receiving tariffs on the imports of some of those products into that marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"While price declined 60 basis points in the quarter, price-cost was positive in all segments and Americas Welding 1.2% lower price reflected the removal of US tariff surcharges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We will also continue to face challenging price comparisons in Americas Welding through the first half of 2020, until we anniversary the removal of the US tariff surcharges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vincent K. Petrella","x":"Now, we haven't put in a significant additional price increases in the Americas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We have operated successfully through economic cycles, with strong cash flow generation, cash conversion and returns and we've already implemented further cost reduction actions to mitigate the impact of the cycle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Walter Liptak","x":"And it sounds like based on Vince's comment, that there is more restructuring that's still needs to be done with Air Liquide Welding.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We are maintaining the cost reduction measures we implemented last year, given these current macro uncertainties.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2019 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We expect these actions will contribute approximately $15 million to $18 million of annualized cost savings, beginning in the second quarter of 2020, but substantially all the benefits are expected to be realized in the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2020-04-27","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Stephen Barger","x":"But what is your team hearing from customers in terms of how automation fits into their cycle planning or how they're thinking about managing their own cost structure going forward, given what we've just been through with the coronavirus and tariffs before that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2020-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2020-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"Despite first quarter sales declining 7.5%, our adjusted operating income margin declined only 40 basis points to 12.6% on favorable mix, price/cost and benefits of our cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2020-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"All regions saw a further deceleration in demand as the COVID-19 impact late in the quarter compressed an already challenged industrial sector which prompted an expansion in our cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2020-07-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Gabriel Bruno","x":"The segment's 30 basis point decline in price primarily reflects the impact of the removal of US tariff surcharges which anniversaried in late Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amanda Butler","x":"Chris will begin the discussion with an overview of our second quarter results and our cost reduction initiatives, and Gabe will cover our second quarter financial performance in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"Our focused execution of cost reduction initiatives generated $27 million in savings, which exceeded our plan and contributed to an adjusted operating profit margin of 10.7% and a 23% decremental margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2020-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"And the story I've always got from you guys is that it's fairly difficult to push pricing through the DIY channel, the customers there have got some pretty good pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2020-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"So is it reasonable for us to expect double-digit price increases for Harris over the next three quarters?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amanda Butler","x":"Chris will begin the discussion with an overview of our quarterly results and our cost reduction initiatives, and Gabe will cover our third quarter financial results in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher Mapes","x":"We held adjusted operating income margins relatively steady versus prior year at 12.6% on improved operating leverage, price management and $27 million of cost savings benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2021-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"We have already issued price increases globally and are preparing further pricing actions to address these inflationary pressures across our markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2021-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gabriel Bruno","x":"Organic sales increased 18% primarily from the continued strength in the North American retail channel and price increases due to rising commodity costs and in particular silver and copper.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2021-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"By aggressively deploying our Lincoln cost savings playbook early in the year and executing on planned permanent cost reduction initiatives, we achieved $88 million of cost saving benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2020 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2021-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"Our cost savings actions yielded $28 million of benefits in the fourth quarter and we exited the year with a $12 million per quarter run rate in permanent cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/12/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gabriel Bruno","x":"Our gross profit margin decreased 30 basis points to 33.5% as benefits from volumes and cost reduction actions were offset by higher raw material and freight costs, including a $3.9 million LIFO charge.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gabriel Bruno","x":"Our SG&A expense declined 2.7% or $4 million reflecting savings from cost reduction actions which was partially offset by approximately $2 million in higher incentive compensation and employee costs as well as approximately $3 million in unfavorable foreign exchange.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2021-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Steve Barger","x":"Chris the pricing strength obviously reflects the big steel price increase in the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2021-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"I'm pleased to report that we achieved record earnings in the quarter, driven by record sales, diligent price cost management, increased productivity and the benefits of our prior cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2021-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"Higher productivity, structural cost savings and disciplined management of discretionary spending, offset higher employee costs, which resulted in a near doubling of our adjusted operating income to $125 million and a 440 basis point increase to our adjusted operating income margin to 15.1%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q2-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gabriel Bruno","x":"And we enter the fourth quarter with another round of price increases because we see some additional material costs and freight challenges, and that's how we manage the price cost management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Dillon Cumming","x":"I guess, what's that kind of imply about the exit rate kind of going into next year, like would that still imply that you're planning to taking the ride of price increases entering '22 do you still maintain that level of neutrality?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher L. Mapes","x":"Volume growth, price management, expense control and benefits of our structural cost reduction actions delivered strong results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gabriel Bruno","x":"Our gross profit margin increased 110 basis points to 33.3% as benefits from volumes, pricing and cost reduction actions offset higher input costs, including raw material and freight costs and an $11 million LIFO charge.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-inc-leco-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"Is that just because there's a large amount of pass-through costs in the robot where you think those margins can get to over the long term?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Mapes","x":"We also benefited from structural cost savings and our higher standard strategy operational initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2021 Q4","e":"leco","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gabe Bruno","x":"Our gross profit margin decreased 70 basis points to 32.3% as additional pricing actions and the benefit of volumes and cost reduction actions did not fully mitigate a $14 million LIFO charge.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2022 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Mapes","x":"The increase reflects better-than-expected volume performance and additional price increases taken to mitigate rising raw material inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q1-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2022 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gabe Bruno","x":"We did announce a price increase beginning of April.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q1-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2022 Q1","e":"leco","d":"2022-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Mapes","x":"…productivity initiatives that we've gotten within our automation business and globally with our restructuring and the work that we're doing on our business model internationally, growth in a host of the areas in our business, a step change in improvement in the operating model in automation…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q1-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2022 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Grabowski","x":"Last quarter, you thought there might have been a pull forward into Q1 due to the April price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2022 Q2","e":"leco","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gabe Bruno","x":"But if you hold steady and we start to anniversary some of the price increases that we put in place in the third and fourth quarter is that's how we get to the overall organic sales assumption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/lincoln-electric-holdings-leco-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"LECO 2025 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2025-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve B. Hedlund","x":"Our global team has done an outstanding job over five very dynamic years that have spanned a global pandemic and a global trade war.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/lincoln-electric-leco-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LECO 2025 Q3","e":"leco","d":"2025-10-30","l":"tariffs","r"